# **6. SHORT‑FORM VS LONG‑FORM RULES**

## **6.1 Short‑Form (30–60 seconds)**
- Faster pacing  
- Stronger hooks  
- Tighter sentences  
- Higher energy  
- Clear emotional direction  
- No long pauses  

## **6.2 Long‑Form (5–30 minutes)**
- Slower pacing  
- More atmospheric  
- More reflective  
- More narrative depth  
- Controlled emotional arcs  
- Documentary cadence  

